    batchlpb             large prime bounds, per side, to be considered by batch cofactorization. Primes between limX and 2^batchlpbX will be extracted by product trees. Defaults to lpbX.
    batch                (switch) use batch cofactorization
    batch-chunk-size     hand at most that many survivors to a single batch cofactorization product tree (0 = no limit, which is the default). Smaller values save memory, at the cost of reducing the large prime product modulo more, smaller trees.
